{"id":"contexte","lemma":"contexte","pos":"noun","rank":4331,"glosses":["context"],"ipa":"/kɔ̃.tɛkst/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/71/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-contexte.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-contexte.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"contextes"},"formAudio":{"contextes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/31/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-contextes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Le contexte est important.","en":"Context is important.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"important"}]},{"text":"Je pense que cela dépend du contexte.","en":"I think it depends on the context.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to depend","l":"dépendre"},{"g":"of the / some"},null]},{"text":"Tout dépend du contexte de la conversation.","en":"Everything depends on the context of the conversation.","words":[{"g":"all"},{"g":"to depend","l":"dépendre"},{"g":"of the / some"},null,null,null,{"g":"conversation"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"of the"]]},{"text":"Cela varie en fonction du contexte.","en":"That depends on the context.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/28962","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"to vary","l":"varier"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"function"},{"g":"of the / some"},null]},{"text":"Mes mots ont été sortis de leur contexte.","en":"My words were taken out of context.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"word","l":"mot"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},{"g":"to exit","l":"sortir"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"them"},null]}]}